   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Forms of feminine and plural genitive",
     "texto": [
      "In the feminine genitive and in the plural, the article becomes **der** (or **einer**, **keiner**, **unserer** with indefinite articles), the adjective takes **-en** and the feminine noun takes no ending: **die Reform der Bundesregierung**, **die Forderungen der Gewerkschaften**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
