    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Crucial dative/genitive contrast in the feminine",
     "texto": [
      "«Der» works both as feminine dative and as feminine genitive. The syntactic position and the government reveal its function: **Ich helfe der Ministerin** (dative, indirect object) versus **die Rede der Ministerin** (genitive, noun complement)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
